# HireMatch AI

- Read `docs/CODEBASE.md` first — keep code simple and DRY.
- Thin routes; business logic in `services/`; reuse `tokens.py`, `workspace.py`, `errors.py`.
- Frontend: reuse `components/ui.tsx` and `lib/api.ts`.
- Follow `docs/PROGRESS.md` phases. Do not skip ahead without approval.
- Never fake AI, payments, or email delivery. Never commit secrets.
- Prefer Docker Compose so any clone works the same.
